<title>BELGIUM: EU not expecting Credit Lyonnais rescue plan today.</title>
<headline>EU not expecting Credit Lyonnais rescue plan today.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission is not expecting to receive the latest plan to rescue Credit Lyonnais today, a Commission spokesman said on Friday .</p>
<p>&quot;We won't get it today,&quot; the spokesman told reporters.</p>
<p>French government sources had said the Commission would get the plan, the third in four years to help the banking group back to viability, this week. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
